Rules:
  [K1] Prefer Jetpack Compose for new UI.
  [K2] Use MVVM with ViewModel.
  [K3] Use coroutines and Flow for async.
  [K4] Use Room for local persistence.
  [K5] Use Retrofit for networking.
  [K6] Use Hilt for dependency injection.
  [K7] Use Navigation Component for routing.
  [K8] Follow Android architecture guidelines.

Pros:
  - Native Android performance
  - Google support
  - Large market share

Cons:
  - Device fragmentation
  - Java legacy
  - Memory constraints

Alternatives:
  - Flutter (cross-platform)
  - React Native (cross-platform)
  - Swift (Apple ecosystem)

